ow, 10:00am – 12:00pm</option><option>Tomorrow, 2:00 – 4:00pm</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"notes\">Anything else? (optional)</label><textarea id=\"notes\" name=\"notes\" placeholder=\"Special requests, allergies...\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></div><button class=\"btn btn--primary\" type=\"submit\">Place order</button></form></aside></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-col\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Hearth and Crumb home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-wheat\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"brand-name\">Hearth &amp; Crumb<span class=\"brand-sub\">Bakery · Est. 2012</span></span></a><p style=\"margin-top: 18px; max-width: 32ch;\">Small-batch bread, pastry and cakes, baked fresh every morning in the heart of the neighbourhood.</p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><a href=\"menu.html\">Menu</a><a href=\"order.html\">Order</a><a href=\"about.html\">Our Story</a><a href=\"visit.html\">Visit Us</a></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Visit</h4><p>18 Willow Lane<br>Old town</p><p>Open daily<br>7am – 5pm</p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>A little note from us</h4><p>Get word of the weekend bakes and the occasional free pastry.</p><form class=\"newsletter\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" aria-label=\"Email address\" required=\"\"><button class=\"btn btn--light btn--small\" type=\"submit\">Join</button><div class=\"form-message\">Thanks! You're on the list.</div></form></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© 2026 Hearth &amp; Crumb Bakery. Made with flour and love.</span><span>Baked fresh, every single day.</span></div></div></footer></div>\n\n\n</body></html>",
